1
00:00:01,433 --> 00:00:02,800
Sure, I'd like to see it.

2
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,166
Promise me you won't laugh.

3
00:00:07,766 --> 00:00:09,100
I won't. Lead the way.

4
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:09,833
Come on in.

5
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:10,966
Okay.

6
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:13,700
This door... what were you thinking
when you painted it?

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,766
I wanted out. I shouldn't have to beg
in my own paintings, too.

8
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:23,300
My parents said it'd just be a few days,
not that I'd be trapped inside.

9
00:00:25,333 --> 00:00:26,166
Stop just staring at me.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,300
You gonna look at the painting or what?

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,466
Where do you want to go the most?

12
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:29,466
Tell me.

13
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:33,166
Buy art supplies, go back to my studio...
I have commissions waiting.

14
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,166
Don't worry. I'll arrange it all for you.

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,900
Are you going to make my decisions, too?

16
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,166
Ah Tan, I don't want to be someone
who has to ask permission for everything.

17
00:00:43,733 --> 00:00:47,200
I misspoke. I'll go talk to Sura
and sort out your coming and going.

18
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,800
But I need the general manager's approval
to leave. Are you going to beg him?

19
00:00:50,933 --> 00:00:53,400
Don't worry about that.
You'll be able to go out tomorrow.

20
00:00:54,266 --> 00:00:56,733
I don't want you owing the general manager
a favor just to help me.

21
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:00,900
Don't worry. I won't have to beg him,
nor owe him any favors.

22
00:01:01,466 --> 00:01:03,233
Nawin, why did you have to fall first?

23
00:01:03,666 --> 00:01:04,633
But he really knows how to sweet-talk me.

24
00:01:04,866 --> 00:01:07,033
Then... stay a little longer.

25
00:01:09,433 --> 00:01:11,433
Okay, I'll stay with you while you paint.

26
00:01:17,733 --> 00:01:20,166
Wait, I haven't decided yet.
